  "description": "Variation of condition no. 2 of planning permission Ref: P0550.23 dated 14/06/23 to permit changes to the principal elevation with a first floor canopy, alterations to fenestration, increase in roof ridge height by 0.5m, 2 rooflights to rear, addition of storage area in loft with maximum internal height of 2m",
